{"parse":{"title":"2026年9月10日维护内容","pageid":9127,"revid":22302,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8810%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8810%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8810%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF\" title=\"铃兰资讯\">铃兰资讯</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"维护\">维护</a> &gt; <b>2026年9月10日维护内容</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8B9.E6.9C.8810.E6.97.A5.E7.BB.B4.E6.8A.A4.E5.86.85.E5.AE.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容\">《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8810%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2026/09/09<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F846812455081349031\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/846812455081349031</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin: 20px 0 -15px 0; font-weight: normal; margin-left:0px;\"><img alt=\"笔记.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/40px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/60px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/80px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />【更新内容】</div><br />\n<p>1.重逢之时：<b>塔埃尔&amp;柯莱丹萨</b><br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/11 12:00 - 2026/09/24 23:59<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n活动期间，角色「塔埃尔」「柯莱丹萨」的邂逅获取概率将大幅提升。<br />\n<br />\n2.「乐土奇货集」活动限时开启<br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/11 00:00 - 2026/09/24 23:59<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n活动期间，与频道内的伙伴们交换信息，前往拜访其他团长的乐土家园，交易奇货，获取奖励。<br />\n<br />\n3.愚者的旅程8-9章「高难模式」开启<br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/11 00:00起<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n愚者的旅程8-9章「高难模式」开启。<br />\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n【祷铃为谁而鸣】修复了「领地经营」中可能出现异常报错的问题。<br />\n【光影回廊】调整了环境「权威之证·避视」的效果，现在虔诚值变化需要主动攻击才会生效。<br />\n【光影回廊】修复了招募支援角色「卡丽丝·庇护之誓」时技能栏为空，并需要手动装配技能的问题。<br />\n【好友切磋】修复了切磋增益调整后，部分物件无法造成环境伤害的问题。<br />\n【显示】修正了部分文本的错别字。<br />\n【战斗】修复了「阿芙拉」技能「冰灾预言」的无视守护效果未正常生效的问题。<br />\n【战斗】修复了「狄奥娜」的普攻「斩月」无法正常触发「巡光使」技能「公正审判」效果的问题。<br />\n【战斗】修复了部分在攻击前有攻击力变化的情况下，获得护盾时的护盾量不正确的问题。<br />\n【战斗】修正了「卡丽丝·庇护之誓」技能「初月庇护」「真爱庇护」及「庇护之力2」的错别字，使之语句通顺，实际效果不受影响。\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021175311\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1917/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 234/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.051      1 -total\n 54.46%   15.276      1 模板:面包屑\n 45.19%   12.677      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:9127-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261021175311 and revision id 22302. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"维护","missing":true}],"images":["笔记.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"2026年9月10日维护内容","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容"}],"displaytitle":"2026年9月10日维护内容","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|维护}}\n=《铃兰之剑》9月10日维护内容=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=维护\n|时间=2026/09/09\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/846812455081349031\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" st